Algorithm: DualMem memory construction and response generation
Require: persona p, chunks C_1...C_T, prior memory M, query q
Ensure: response y_hat and updated memory M
for i = 1 to T:
  F_i <- ExtractFacts(C_i, p)
  I_i <- BuildInsights(F_i, M_{<i}, p)
  M_i <- {F_i, I_i}
  M <- M union M_i
R_q <- Retrieve(M, q)
if retrieved insight I_j exists:
  include linked facts F_j
return f_phi(p, q, R_q)
